id: pm-vcs-identity-isolation
title: Review unreachable Git identity metadata without weakening the audit
description: "Define a safe owner-reviewed workflow for unapproved physical Git metadata outside a candidate history. Keep the all-object identity audit fail-closed, preserve unreviewed objects, and do not broaden the identity allowlist. Exact-head disposable checkouts can isolate release evidence from unrelated physical objects."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 3
