comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-03T02:05:57.066Z",codex-sol,One rejected physical commit was confirmed unreachable from every ref and absent from the candidate ancestry. The candidate commit and all reachable candidate commits use approved metadata. No rejected address or object identifier is recorded here. Original objects and identity policy remain unchanged pending owner review.
  "2026-11-06T18:39:12.701Z",codex-astra,"Additional bounded evidence from pm-vcs-phase6moves at 243c627: the shared physical object database rejects one unapproved address, while a fresh reachable-only clone of the candidate branch passes scripts/audit-git-identities.ts with five approved identities. New branch commits use the required public identity. No shared objects, history or allowlists were changed; existing owner-reviewed isolation work remains open."
